# Ashe, Princess of Dalmasca: "Whenever Ashe attacks, look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card
# from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." On turn 3 the fifth
# card is Sol Ring (taken; exactly five are looked at) and the four Islands go to the bottom. On turn 5 the five hold a Mox
# Emerald and Bot1 declines it: all five go to the bottom, the library keeps its size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ashe, Princess of Dalmasca
Island x8
Sol Ring
Island x3
Mox Emerald
Island x3

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ashe, Princess of Dalmasca.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ashe, Princess of Dalmasca > Bot2)
Bot1.Arrange(Sol Ring | Island; Island; Island; Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 11
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ashe, Princess of Dalmasca > Bot2)
! Bot1.Arrange(Island | Island; Mox Emerald; Island; Island)
Bot1.Arrange( | Island; Island; Mox Emerald; Island; Island)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Life = 14
